<title>POLAND: BETON STAL TURNS TO PROFIT IN FEBRUARY.</title>
<headline>BETON STAL TURNS TO PROFIT IN FEBRUARY.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.02 vs   0.10 loss</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.02 vs   0.10 loss</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.04 vs   0.16 loss</p>
<p> Sales		    2.91 vs   0.65</p>
<p>JANUARY-FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.07 vs   0.17 loss</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.07 vs   0.17 loss</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.21 vs   0.23 loss</p>
<p> Sales		    4.88 vs   1.12</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction company is Beton</p>
<p>Stal SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
